  slide "B · Input resolution" {
    eyebrow: "INPUT RESOLUTION"
    title: "Three resolvers, one strict decode each"
    lede: "All injected into the coordinator and side-effect-free at validation time."
    narration: "Component B — input resolution. Three resolvers each do the sole strict decode of their input into a prepared value. The graph adapter (dag_jsonl, weka, dynamo, aiperf) produces a GraphInputBundle that bypasses the linear loader registry. The dataset adapter (synthetic, file, public) produces a PreparedDatasetInput, materialized online or hash-identity under dynosim. The sidecar adapter decodes 5 sidecars into a type-erased PreparedSidecarInputs."
    caption: "Three adapters · one strict decode each → a prepared value."
    render: @scene {
      sdk.Shape(id = "ir-badge", variant = "rect", label = "B", x = 123, y = 43.2, width = 91.8, height = 91.8, surfaceRole = theme(accent.primary))
