  slide "I · Phase lifecycle" {
    eyebrow: "PHASE STATE MACHINE"
    title: "Warmup before profiling, one escalation order"
    lede: "ClockPhaseRunner drives a fixed sequence; the orchestrator enforces ordering and seamless overlap."
    narration: "Component I, the phase state machine — warmup before profiling, one escalation order. ClockPhaseRunner drives a fixed sequence: configure, setup, start, ramps, issuance, freeze, grace, cancel-inflight, drain, force complete. The orchestrator enforces ordering and seamless overlap. Each PhaseState advances Created, Started, SendingComplete, Complete. PhaseKind is Warmup or Profiling; GracePeriod is Disabled, Finite, or Infinite; CompletionReason is Completed, GraceTimeout, Cancelled, ForceCompleted, or Failed. SIGINT and SIGTERM lower a cancellation latch, and the AIPerf System is PROFILING banner is emitted on stderr."
    caption: "Fixed escalation order · PhaseState machine · cancellation latch."
    render: @scene {
      sdk.Shape(id = "pl-badge", variant = "rect", label = "I", x = 123, y = 32.4, width = 86.4, height = 86.4, surfaceRole = theme(accent.primary))
      sdk.Label(id = "pl-badge-l", text = "I", x = 123, y = 48.6, width = 86.4, height = 54, inkRole = theme(ink.primary))
