    title: "Ramp until failure, step back to the knee"
    lede: "Discover raises the load knob each window until an SLA breach — then Sustain holds the last-passing boundary."
    narration: "Component M — adaptive scale: ramp until failure, step back to the knee. Discover monotonically raises the load knob each assessment window until an SLA-threshold breach; then Sustain holds the last-passing boundary, the knee. Four control variables can be driven: concurrency, prefill_concurrency, request_rate, and users. The object-safe seam is ControlActuator, SlaEvaluator, StepPolicy, Controller, and WindowSampler. It steps by SLA-margin-scaled or fixed-percent, and the same futures run online and offline — everything sits behind Clock and ControlActuator."
